commit f9c075b9b5b1a0e4e077e5dfb8f7bcdc2df1bb18
Author: bzli <bzli@local>
Date:   Mon Oct 26 05:47:21 2026 +0000

    feat(cgmo): merge CUDA graph memory optimization into the share-prefix tree
    
    Pack graph intermediates into one arena and fold repeated decoder layers so a DeepSeek-V3.1 pdmux capture drops from 10.2 GB to 3.3 GB per GPU. The tool stays off unless CGMO is set, and the oar_done share-prefix path is unchanged.

